= Results <sec-results>

The committed matrix has 3365 cells: 1955 KEM cells at 200 trials each, and 1410 signature cells
(1280 for the transition pair at 200 trials, 130 for the dual-PQ pair at 12). Every control,
claim check and expectation check passed, and no cell contradicts a pre-stated expectation. The
heat maps aggregate cells over adversaries: a (pattern, design, game) square is BROKEN if any
implemented adversary for that game won. @tab-summary counts the squares per design and
@fig-summary plots its one-failure column.

