*Dual post-quantum pair.* With real SLH-DSA, `Vyra` shows no win in any game with one Forgeable
component, and is BROKEN only in STRIP-COMPOSITE with a ContextIgnoring component (2 of 32
squares); `Concat` is BROKEN in 20 of 32. At 12 trials per cell this is weak evidence: a zero-win
cell bounds the success probability only below 0.356 at 99% confidence.

